	"descriptionMarkdown": "Chunk aligned, automatic city-block train network.\n\nTrains will automatically seek out with the following rules in mind.\nAll stations have been designed to allow a second train to be buffered to avoid lost cargo transfer times.\n\n[virtual-signal=signal-item-parameter] LOAD:\nRename a station to this name and trains will automatically load from here\n\n[virtual-signal=signal-item-parameter] UNLOAD:\nReplace [virtual-signal=signal-alert] in the station name with the item's picture to request this specific item to this station\n\n[virtual-signal=signal-star] REFUEL:\nRename a station to this name for it to act as a fuel station for your trains\n\n[virtual-signal=signal-info] DEPOT:\nRename a station to this name for it to act as a depot where unused trains are stored\n\nI want to give credit to other automatic train network creators.\nThis template was created to be more simple and compact.",
